One note on strict ISO parsing: `ResolverStyle.STRICT` with pattern `yyyy-MM-dd` requires a year-of-era and would need an era field. To avoid that pitfall, I should use `uuuu` instead of `yyyy`, which represents the proleptic year and works with STRICT.
